# Keep rules for the instrumented test APK only — testBuildType = "release" means R8 processes
# it too, and androidx.test's classes carry Error Prone annotations whose classes are not on any
# runtime classpath. They are compile-time-only annotations, so nothing looks for them at run
# time and the warning is the whole of the problem.
#
# This suppresses warnings; it does not keep anything. Nothing here applies to the app APK — a
# keep rule that weakened the shipped build would defeat the point of testing the shipped build.
-dontwarn com.google.errorprone.annotations.CanIgnoreReturnValue
-dontwarn com.google.errorprone.annotations.MustBeClosed
